WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:11.060
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie welcome to my
channel.

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:15.700
I’m such a huge fan of science fiction and
fantasy that I make videos to talk about all

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:17.240
my favorite fandoms with you guys.

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:21.670
Right now I’m making 6 to 8 videos a week
for specific fandoms including Doctor Who,

00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:24.430
Game Of Thrones, Walking Dead, American Horror
Story, Arrow, Supernatural, Sleepy Hollow,

00:00:24.430 --> 00:00:26.390
Agents Of SHIELD, Legend Of Korra.

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:30.970
I like to think of youtube as a place full
of friends you haven’t met yet and part

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:31.970
of the reason I make videos is to make new
fandom friends to nerd out on stuff with.

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:35.460
Think of it as being a less disgusting version
of Tumblr if it were run by abed from community.

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:39.980
I also do videos for all my favorite movie
franchises like The Hobbit, Star Wars, Marvel,

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:44.400
Man Of Steel and I’m even working on doing
video games in the not too distant future.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:49.050
Every once in a while I partner with big networks
like BBC America for Doctor Who content.

00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:52.309
I just got done doing a huge livestream for
the 50th Anniversary.

00:00:52.309 --> 00:00:56.900
And I’ll be doing a bunch of awesome stuff
for the Christmas Special and Sherlock in

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:57.900
January.

00:00:57.900 --> 00:01:01.460
I add new shows and movies all the time and
really like it when you guys send me new suggestions

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:02.460
for awesome stuff to check out.

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:04.530
I even give away a ton of free on a regular
basis to the most awesome of subscribers.

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:07.710
There’s a lot of new stuff coming this winter
and in January so be sure to subscribe to

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:10.080
join the conversation and get all the new
stuff.

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:13.050
You can also find links to all my social accounts
on my channel page.

00:01:13.050 --> 00:01:17.479
If there’s some awesome science fiction,
fantasy or other genre fandoms that you really

00:01:17.479 --> 00:01:21.050
want to nerd out on let me know and I’ll
add them to my list of videos to make.

00:01:21.050 --> 00:01:23.890
Thanks so much for watching, see you guys
tonight.

00:01:23.890 --> 00:01:26.529
High fives!

